Package: zellij
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: terminal workspace with batteries included
 Zellij is a terminal workspace. It has the base functionality
 of a terminal multiplexer (similar to tmux or screen) but
 includes many built-in features that allow users to extend
 it and create their own personalized environment.
 .
 Includes a plugin system (WebAssembly), layouts, floating panes,
 session resurrection and a built-in web client.
